58
00:03:23.252 --> 00:03:28.270
was. "Our gods are good to us if we are good to them," Mazatl

59
00:03:28.271 --> 00:03:33.067
said. "How are you good to the gods?" Mandy

60
00:03:33.068 --> 00:03:36.014
